	"description" : "This is a sequel to [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3088099655]Terminal Wallpaper[/url].\n\n[b]Main Features[/b]\n[list]\n[*] Clock and date display\n[*] Minute / hour / day / week / month / year progress indicators\n[*] Sunrise and sunset times based on latitude and longitude\n[*] [url=https://github.com/sheetau/PerformanceMonitor/releases/latest]Performance Monitor[/url] with fully customizable layout (via performance.layout.js in project folder)\n[*] Currently playing music information\n[*] Two configurable world clocks\n[*] Weather information based on latitude and longitude\n[*] Monitor and cursor information display\n[*] System log display\n[*] Full customization support: fonts, font size, margins, opacity, colors, filters, and more\n[*] Hidden stopwatch mode by clicking the time box (double-click to exit)\n[*] Supports any screen resolution and aspect ratio\n[/list]\n\nFor information or inquiries about the performance monitor, please visit:\n[url=https://github.com/sheetau/PerformanceMonitor]https://github.com/sheetau/PerformanceMonitor[/url]\n\nTry disabling filters if the wallpaper is affecting your PC's performance.\n\nmade with HTML, CSS, Javascript.\n\nwallpaper creator: sheet4.vn\ntags: customizable, world clock, clock, date, time, day, progress, audio responsive, music player, interactive, visualizer, album cover, duration, web, animation, 4k, 21:9, performance monitor, weather, performance, task manager, sunset, sunrise, sun, volume",
